#: templates/index.html:21
msgid "L’única plataforma de transcripció dissenyada per a documents reals"
msgstr "The only transcription platform designed for real documents"

#: templates/index.html:23
msgid ""
"Converteix imatges tipogràfiques en text editable, classificat i "
"exportable, sense necessitat de saber utilitzar la intel·ligència "
"artificial. Transcriu, classifica i transforma imatges tipogràfiques en "
"dades útils amb la màxima confiança i sense coneixements tècnics."
msgstr ""
"Convert typographic images into editable, classified, and exportable text"
" without needing to know how to use artificial intelligence. Transcribe, "
"classify, and transform typographic images into useful data with maximum "
"reliability and no technical knowledge required."

#: templates/index.html:27
msgid "TRANSCRIU GRATIS"
msgstr "TRANSCRIBE FOR FREE"

#: templates/index.html:30
msgid "DEMO PERSONALITZADA"
msgstr "PERSONALIZED DEMO"

#: templates/index.html:37
msgid ""
"Oblida’t de copiar i enganxar o d’escriure instruccions a ChatGPT. "
"Nosaltres ens encarreguem de tot."
msgstr ""
"Forget about copying and pasting or writing instructions in ChatGPT. We "
"take care of everything."

#: templates/index.html:38
msgid "DESCOBREIX LES UTILITATS DE LA PLATAFORMA"
msgstr "DISCOVER THE PLATFORM'S UTILITIES"

#: templates/index.html:44
msgid ""
"La nostra IA no és genèrica: ha après a llegir padrons, expedients, actes"
" i documents antics, com ho faria un lector humà expert"
msgstr ""
"Our AI is not generic: it has learned to read census records, case files,"
" minutes, and old documents just like an expert human reader would."

#: templates/index.html:45 templates/index.html:88
msgid ""
"Cada dada està vinculada al seu origen visual. Tu tens el control total "
"sobre què entra a la teva base de dades."
msgstr ""
"Each piece of data is linked to its visual source. You have full control "
"over what enters your database."

#: templates/index.html:57
msgid "La nostra IA no és genèrica"
msgstr "Our AI is not generic"

#: templates/index.html:58
msgid ""
"Ha après a llegir padrons, expedients, actes i documents antics com ho "
"faria un lector humà expert"
msgstr ""
"It has learned to read census records, case files, minutes, and old "
"documents just like an expert human reader would."

#: templates/index.html:69
msgid "Sense prompts"
msgstr "Without prompts"

#: templates/index.html:71
msgid ""
"No cal escriure instruccions ni copiar i enganxar. Nosaltres ens "
"encarreguem de tot: estructura, format, correcció i utilitat real."
msgstr ""
"No need to write instructions or copy and paste. We take care of "
"everything: structure, format, correction, and real usability."

#: templates/index.html:86
msgid "Conserva l’origen visual"
msgstr "Preserve the visual origin"

#: templates/index.html:101
msgid "Detecta informació rellevant"
msgstr "Detect relevant information"

#: templates/index.html:102
msgid ""
"Identifica automàticament persones, dates i relacions clau sense "
"necessitat de configurar res"
msgstr ""
"Automatically identifies people, dates, and key relationships without any"
" configuration needed."

#: templates/index.html:115
msgid "Gestió completa d’arxius"
msgstr "Complete file management"

#: templates/index.html:117
msgid ""
"Organitza, etiqueta i cerca fàcilment entre lots de documents. Tot "
"connectat entre les dades, la imatge i el text"
msgstr ""
"Organize, tag, and easily search through batches of documents. Everything"
" is connected between the data, the image, and the text."

#: templates/index.html:126
msgid ""
"Cada dada que veus està vinculada amb el seu origen visual. Tu tens el "
"control total sobre què entra a la teva base de dades.<br><br>No cal "
"escriure instruccions ni copiar i enganxar.<br>Nosaltres ens encarreguem "
"de tot: estructura, format, correcció i utilitat real."
msgstr ""
"Every piece of data you see is linked to its visual source. You have full"
" control over what enters your database.<br><br>No need to write "
"instructions or copy and paste.<br>We take care of everything: structure,"
" format, correction, and real usability."

#: templates/index.html:134
msgid ""
"La nostra plataforma està pensada<br>per a qui necessita processar "
"documents reals,<br>no només jugar amb la IA."
msgstr ""
"Our platform is designed<br>for those who need to process real "
"documents,<br>not just play with AI."

#: templates/index.html:140 templates/index.html:147
msgid "ARXIUS MUNICIPALS"
msgstr "MUNICIPAL ARCHIVES"

#: templates/index.html:143
msgid ""
"Digitalitza padrons i censos, classificats per camps i amb precisió "
"verificable."
msgstr ""
"Digitize census and registry records, classified by fields and with "
"verifiable accuracy."

#: templates/index.html:149
msgid ""
"Digitalitza padrons i censos classificats per camps i amb precisió "
"verificable, pensada per a arxius i administracions locals."
msgstr ""
"Digitize census and registry records, classified by fields and with "
"verifiable accuracy, designed for archives and local administrations."

#: templates/index.html:159
msgid "Cada dada es pot rastrejar fins a la imatge original. Així es treballa bé."
msgstr ""
"Each piece of data can be traced back to the original image. That’s how "
"proper work is done."

#: templates/index.html:166 templates/index.html:173
msgid "GENEALOGISTES I HISTORIADORS"
msgstr "GENEALOGISTS AND HISTORIANS"

#: templates/index.html:169 templates/index.html:175
msgid "Troba noms, cognoms, dates clau i relacions entre persones en minuts"
msgstr ""
"Find names, surnames, key dates, and relationships between people in "
"minutes."

#: templates/index.html:189
msgid "Una vida sencera en paper, ara llegible, ordenada i accessible."
msgstr "A whole life on paper, now readable, organized, and accessible."

#: templates/index.html:196 templates/index.html:203
msgid "ESCOLES I UNIVERSITATS"
msgstr "SCHOOLS AND UNIVERSITIES"

#: templates/index.html:199 templates/index.html:205
msgid "Estructura expedients antics o material d’arxiu sense personal tècnic"
msgstr "Structure old records or archive material without technical staff."

#: templates/index.html:214
msgid "El teu equip pot transcriure sense saber programació ni IA"
msgstr "Your team can transcribe without knowing programming or AI."

#: templates/index.html:221 templates/index.html:228
msgid "ADMINISTRACIÓ PÚBLICA"
msgstr "PUBLIC ADMINISTRATION"

#: templates/index.html:224 templates/index.html:230
msgid "Converteix documents antics en bases de dades reutilitzables"
msgstr "Convert old documents into reusable databases."

#: templates/index.html:240
msgid "Transparència, arxiu i reutilització en un sol clic."
msgstr "Transparency, archiving, and reuse in a single click."

#: templates/index.html:248
msgid "ENTITATS DE MEMÒRIA HISTÒRICA"
msgstr "HISTORICAL MEMORY ENTITIES"

#: templates/index.html:251 templates/index.html:257
msgid "Preserva el patrimoni documental amb precisió i sense barreres tècniques."
msgstr ""
"Preserve documentary heritage with precision and without technical "
"barriers."

#: templates/index.html:255
msgid "ENTITATS MEMÒRIA HISTÒRICA"
msgstr "HISTORICAL MEMORY ENTITIES"

#: templates/index.html:270
msgid "Donem forma digital al passat per protegir-lo en el futur."
msgstr "We give digital form to the past to protect it for the future."

#: templates/index.html:280
msgid "Plans i tarifes"
msgstr "Plans and pricing"

#: templates/index.html:285
msgid "QUÈ INCLOU LA PROVA GRATUÏTA?"
msgstr "WHAT DOES THE FREE TRIAL INCLUDE?"

#: templates/index.html:288
msgid ""
"Fes la teva primera transcripció gratis i comprova què és tenir el "
"control.<br>Descobreix el poder d’una IA entrenada per entendre els teus "
"documents.<br><br>No necessites saber utilitzar IA, OCR ni programació."
msgstr ""
"Do your first transcription for free and experience what it’s like to be "
"in control.<br>Discover the power of an AI trained to understand your "
"documents.<br><br>You don’t need to know AI, OCR, or programming."

#: templates/index.html:292
msgid "Processa 2 imatges tipogràfiques reals"
msgstr "Process 2 real typographic images"

#: templates/index.html:293
msgid "Vista prèvia del text alineat amb la imatge original"
msgstr "Preview of the text aligned with the original image"

#: templates/index.html:294
msgid "Descarrega un exemple amb sortida estructurada en Excel"
msgstr "Download a sample with structured output in Excel"

#: templates/index.html:295
msgid "Accés complet al panell amb funcions avançades visibles"
msgstr "Full access to the panel with visible advanced features"

#: templates/index.html:296
msgid "Utilitza una IA que sap què fas, sense instruir ni explicar res"
msgstr ""
"Use an AI that understands what you do without instructions or "
"explanations"

#: templates/index.html:297
msgid "Sense targeta, sense compromís"
msgstr "No card required, no commitment"

#: templates/index.html:298
msgid "10 crèdits al mes"
msgstr "10 credits per month"

#: templates/index.html:304
msgid "FREE"
msgstr "FREE"

#: templates/index.html:306 templates/index.html:329
msgid "al mes"
msgstr "per month"

#: templates/index.html:308 templates/index.html:331
msgid "Crear compte"
msgstr "Create account"

#: templates/index.html:311
msgid "Descàrrega de transcripcions <br> en <strong>txt</strong>"
msgstr "Download transcripts <br> in <strong>txt</strong>"

#: templates/index.html:312
msgid ""
"<strong>Càrrega documents 1 per 1</strong> (lots petits), sense ZIP, lots"
" ni coles prioritzades."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Upload documents one by one</strong> (small batches), no ZIP, no "
"grouped uploads or priority queues."

#: templates/index.html:313
msgid "<strong>Edició manual</strong>/validació bàsica"
msgstr "<strong>Manual editing</strong>/basic validation"

#: templates/index.html:314
msgid "<strong>Historial</strong> dels darrers <strong>7 dies</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>History</strong> of the last <strong>7 days</strong>"

#: templates/index.html:315
msgid "Retenció <strong>7 dies</strong>"
msgstr "Retention of <strong>7 days</strong>"

#: templates/index.html:316
msgid "<strong>1 usuari</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>1 user</strong>"

#: templates/index.html:317
msgid "<strong>Sense</strong> integracions"
msgstr "<strong>No</strong> integrations"

#: templates/index.html:318
msgid "<strong>Suport amb email estàndard</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Standard email support</strong>"

#: templates/index.html:319
msgid "Model de IA <strong>bàsic</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Basic</strong> AI model"

#: templates/index.html:320
msgid "<strong>Castellà, català i anglès</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Spanish, Catalan and English</strong>"

#: templates/index.html:321
msgid ""
"No transcripció de manuscrits, <strong>només documents "
"tipogràfics</strong>"
msgstr "No handwritten transcription, <strong>only printed documents</strong>"

#: templates/index.html:327
msgid "PREMIUM"
msgstr "PREMIUM"

#: templates/index.html:334
msgid "Descàrrega de transcripcions en <strong>TXT, DOCX o PDF</strong>"
msgstr "Download transcripts in <strong>TXT, DOCX or PDF</strong>"

#: templates/index.html:335
msgid ""
"<strong>Càrrega massiva</strong> documents per lots, carpetes ZIP, o "
"coles prioritzades"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Bulk upload</strong> of documents by batches, ZIP folders or "
"priority queues"

#: templates/index.html:336
msgid "<strong>Edició avançada</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Advanced editing</strong>"

#: templates/index.html:337
msgid ""
"Creació de la teva pròpia <strong>base de dades</strong> a partir del "
"document"
msgstr "Create your own <strong>database</strong> from the document"

#: templates/index.html:338
msgid ""
"<strong>Bot de suport</strong> sobre qualsevol recerca del contingut del "
"document"
msgstr "<strong>Support bot</strong> for any search within the document content"

#: templates/index.html:339
msgid "<strong>Historial complet</strong>, logs i versionat"
msgstr "<strong>Full history</strong>, logs and versioning"

#: templates/index.html:340
msgid ""
"Retenció <strong>30–90 dies</strong> (configurable) + esborrat sota "
"demanda"
msgstr ""
"Retention of <strong>30–90 days</strong> (configurable) + deletion on "
"demand"

#: templates/index.html:341
msgid "<strong>Multiusuari</strong>, rols (Admin/operador)"
msgstr "<strong>Multi-user</strong>, roles (Admin/operator)"

#: templates/index.html:342
msgid "Amb <strong>integració</strong>"
msgstr "With <strong>integration</strong>"

#: templates/index.html:343
msgid ""
"<strong>Suport tècnic prioritari</strong>. Correu d’avís al acabar la "
"transcripció"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Priority technical support</strong>. Email notification when "
"transcription is completed"

#: templates/index.html:344
msgid "Model de IA <strong>avançat</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Advanced</strong> AI model"

#: templates/index.html:345
msgid "<strong>Multi idioma</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Multi-language</strong>"

#: templates/index.html:346
msgid "Transcripció de <strong>manuscrits</strong>"
msgstr "Transcription of <strong>handwritten documents</strong>"

#: templates/index.html:352
msgid "UTILITATS"
msgstr "UTILITIES"

#: templates/index.html:353
msgid "Descobreix tot el que pots fer amb aquesta eina"
msgstr "Discover everything you can do with this tool"

#: templates/index.html:357
msgid "Convertir imatges en text sense esforç"
msgstr "Convert images to text effortlessly"

#: templates/index.html:358
msgid "Treballar amb dades en eines conegudes"
msgstr "Work with data in familiar tools"

#: templates/index.html:359
msgid "Extreure i unificar noms, dates, llocs, professors, etc."
msgstr "Extract and unify names, dates, locations, teachers, etc."

#: templates/index.html:360
msgid "Obté resultats nets fins i tot de digitalitzats difícils"
msgstr "Get clean results even from difficult scans"

#: templates/index.html:361
msgid "Centenars de documents de cop, sense teclejar manualment"
msgstr "Hundreds of documents at once, without manual typing"

#: templates/index.html:362
msgid ""
"Ideal per a arxius i investigadors. Mantén l’arxiu digital ordenat i "
"accessible"
msgstr ""
"Ideal for archives and researchers. Keep your digital archive organized "
"and accessible"

#: templates/index.html:363
msgid ""
"Transcriu i adapta el flux a les teves necessitats. Resol dubtes reals "
"amb persones, no formularis."
msgstr ""
"Transcribe and adapt the workflow to your needs. Solve real questions "
"with people, not forms."

#: templates/index.html:364
msgid "Revisa el que has fet i no perdràs res"
msgstr "Review your work and you won’t lose anything"

#: templates/index.html:373
msgid "Així funciona la nostra plataforma"
msgstr "How our platform works"

#: templates/index.html:379
msgid "PAS 1"
msgstr "STEP 1"

#: templates/index.html:381
msgid "Donat d’alta com a usuari"
msgstr "Sign up as a user"

#: templates/index.html:382
msgid "1) Selecciona la modalitat FREE o PREMIUM"
msgstr "1) Select the FREE or PREMIUM plan"

#: templates/index.html:383
msgid "2) Selecciona el Pack de consum:"
msgstr "2) Select your credit pack:"

#: templates/index.html:386
msgid "De prova amb 10 crèdits per 0 €"
msgstr "Trial with 10 credits for €0"

#: templates/index.html:387
msgid "Lite amb 200 crèdits (19 €)"
msgstr "Lite with 200 credits (€19)"

#: templates/index.html:388
msgid "Pro amb 1.000 crèdits (89 €)"
msgstr "Pro with 1,000 credits (€89)"

#: templates/index.html:389
msgid "Power amb 5.000 crèdits (275 €)"
msgstr "Power with 5,000 credits (€275)"

#: templates/index.html:393
msgid "1 crèdit = 1 pàgina tipogràfica"
msgstr "1 credit = 1 printed page"

#: templates/index.html:394
msgid "Nota: El Pack no canvia les prestacions, únicament el consum"
msgstr "Note: The pack does not change the features, only the usage amount"

#: templates/index.html:402
msgid "PAS 2"
msgstr "STEP 2"

#: templates/index.html:404
msgid "Puja la teva imatge o document"
msgstr "Upload your image or document"

#: templates/index.html:406
msgid ""
"Admet imatges antigues, una foto des del mòbil o un escaneig en PDF. "
"L’arrossegues, el puges i ja està. No cal netejar la imatge ni saber si "
"és OCR friendly. La nostra IA s’adapta. Admet JPG, PNG i PDFs"
msgstr ""
"Accepts old images, a photo from your phone, or a scanned PDF. Just drag "
"and upload — no need to clean the image or check OCR compatibility. Our "
"AI adapts automatically. Accepts JPG, PNG, and PDFs."

#: templates/index.html:415
msgid "PAS 3"
msgstr "STEP 3"

#: templates/index.html:417
msgid "Gestiona"
msgstr "Manage"

#: templates/index.html:419
msgid ""
"Consulta la transcripció, edita i modifica. Gestió de l’historial. "
"Descarrega els documents que vulguis. Genera la base de dades que "
"necessitis. Analitza el contingut del document amb un assistent "
"especialitzat"
msgstr ""
"Review the transcription, edit and modify it. Manage your history. "
"Download any documents you want. Generate the database you need. Analyze "
"the document’s content with a specialized assistant."

#: templates/index.html:429
msgid ""
"Tens molts documents per digitalitzar o necessites adaptar el flux a la "
"teva organització?"
msgstr ""
"Do you have many documents to digitize or need to adapt the workflow to "
"your organization?"

#: templates/index.html:430
msgid "Oferim solucions a mida per a arxius, investigadors i administracions."
msgstr ""
"We offer tailored solutions for archives, researchers, and "
"administrations."

#: templates/index.html:439
msgid "PROVA LA PLATAFORMA GRATIS"
msgstr "TRY THE PLATFORM FOR FREE"

#: templates/index.html:440
